{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"PSF-2026-34","published":"2026-07-28T13:46:30.650Z","modified":"2026-07-29T13:45:07.735637212Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-6879"],"details":"`Element.findall()` and fully-consumed `Element.iterfind()` exhibit `O(n^2)` time complexity when using XPath index predicates (e.g. `[1]`, `[last()]`, `[last()-N]`) on XML documents with many same-tag siblings. `Element.find()` is only affected when the first match is near the end  of the sibling list, such as with `[last()]` or `[last()-N]`;  `.//item[1]` short-circuits after the first match.","affected":[{"ranges":[{"type":"GIT","repo":"https://github.com/python/cpython","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2ffab083782968a4d732738f4f1dff6bbd69d2b0"}]}],"versions":["v3.15.0b1","v3.15.0a8","v3.15.0a7","v3.15.0a6","v3.15.0a5","v3.15.0a4","v3.15.0a3","v3.15.0a2","v3.15.0a1","v3.14.0b1","v3.14.0a7","v3.14.0a6","v3.14.0a5","v3.14.0a4","v3.14.0a3","v3.14.0a2","v3.14.0a1","v3.13.0b1","v3.13.0a6","v3.13.0a5","v3.13.0a4","v3.13.0a3","v3.13.0a2","v3.13.0a1","v3.12.0b1","v3.12.0a7","v3.12.0a6","v3.12.0a5","v3.12.0a4","v3.12.0a3","v3.12.0a2","v3.12.0a1","v3.11.0b1","v3.11.0a7","v3.11.0a6","v3.11.0a5","v3.11.0a4","v3.11.0a3","v3.10.0a7","v3.10.0a1","v3.9.0a2","v3.7.0a2","v3.6.0b1","v3.6.0a3","v3.5.0b1","v3.5.0a4","v3.5.0a3","v3.5.0a2","v3.5.0a1","v3.4.0b3","v3.4.0b2","v3.4.0b1","v3.4.0a4","v3.4.0a3","v3.4.0a2","v3.4.0a1","v3.3.0rc3","v3.3.0rc2","v3.3.0rc1","v3.3.0b2","v3.3.0b1","v3.3.0a4","v3.3.0a3","v3.3.0a2","v3.2rc3","v3.2rc2","v3.2rc1","v3.2b2","v3.2b1","v3.2a4","v3.2a3","v3.2a2","v3.2a1","v3.1","v3.1rc2","v3.1rc1","v3.1b1","v3.1a2","v3.1a1","v3.0rc3","v3.0rc2","v3.0rc1","v3.0b3","v3.0b2","v3.0b1","v3.0a5","v3.0a4","v3.0a3","v3.0a2","v3.0a1","v2.4","v2.4c1","v2.4b2","v2.4b1","v2.4a3","v2.4a2","v2.4a1","v2.3c2","v2.3c1","v2.2a3","v2.1","v2.1c2","v2.1c1","v2.1b2","v2.1b1","v2.1a2","v2.1a1","v2.0","v2.0c1","v2.0b2","v2.0b1","v1.6a2","v1.6a1","v1.5.2","v1.5.2c1","v1.5.2b2","v1.5.2b1","v1.5.2a2","v1.5.2a1","v1.5